          <td valign=top>
            <a name="DESC">
            Summer is upon us and I cannot possibly justify paying for all these accounts when I am not going to be playing, so it is liquidation time. Step right into the endgame and buy this level 65 epic druid currently on the Bristlebane server (could easily be moved to Legends). This character has 163AAs and some nice gear. Check out his magelo: . …………………………………. http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=1024543 . . . ……………………………… He is a wood elf and has most all pieces of ornate, his epic, and a full set of elysian in the bank too. Standard tier 2 flags is all (including tactics) – still need a few kills for Elementals. He has several pieces of ES armor (for the clickies) and solos easily in tactics for great experience.  He has insta click invis (the AA) and group regen from his tunic and root from his legs.  Add that to the two mana free dots and mana free snare (dots from es arms and epic and snare from es gloves) and you can even solo when you are out of mana.  He has all the critical spells to 65 including the coveted group 9 spell. Also included is level 28 warrior (stripped). The account has all expansions through LoY enabled and it is active but has not been played since last fall (hence no LDoN or GoD).  It is, of course, in good standing on BB. I will accept western union, USPS money order, or verified paypal (where the buyer’s e-mail matches their PA e-mail). Please do not bid on the account if you have less than 5 positive feedbacks on PA (prefer them to be a bit spread out). I reserve the right to discuss this transaction with you on the phone if you plan to use paypal and I suspect something is amiss. I am a highly ethical seller and I choose to do business with only ethical buyers. My feedback reflects this, so bid with confidence. This account is being sold with no minimum and no reserve; I am serious about getting rid of this stuff. Contact me with questions, but for starters he prefer not to move him to another server besides legends, I don't have CD keys (nor do you need them), and I won't take trades or payments. Happy bidding and au revoir EQ.
